Licensing for the HarnessMinimizer evaluation artifact
====================================================

Copyright (C) 2026 HarnessMinimizer Authors

This repository contains components under different licenses. The source-file
notices and the component descriptions below identify the applicable terms.

1. HarnessMinimizer tool code
----------------------------

Original HarnessMinimizer code copied or adapted from the main repository is
subject to LICENSE.HarnessMinimizer, which reproduces the main repository's
dual-license terms: AGPL-3.0-only or a separately negotiated commercial license.
No commercial license is granted by this repository.

Upstream license:
https://github.com/FuzzAnything/HarnessMinimizer/blob/main/LICENSE

The included copy was taken from main repository revision:
a4db4337c34eb15da43f9409b2e103891ba8e19f

This applies to the original tool files under src/harnessminimizer/, include/,
tests/, tools/perses/, and tools/treereduce/, and to Dockerfile and
pyproject.toml. The MIT files listed in section 2 and third-party material
identified in section 3 have the additional or separate terms stated there.
Source files identify the applicable license in their headers. Binary tools
and the treereduce patch have adjacent .license files.

The upstream SPDX notice in include/fuzzer/FuzzedDataProvider.h is preserved.
Its LLVM portions retain Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception terms in addition to
the terms applying to the modified HarnessMinimizer file. The adapted runtime
src/harnessminimizer/fdp_replay_runtime.cpp also retains the LLVM terms.

